# Five accesses of one row, at two positions. Each held its position against the row's length for itself. In the arm for a view the stretch may still run as written while nothing was done in it: there each of
# the two positions is held below the length once, in front of its first read, and the accesses that follow, the two stores among them, lie inside the view without a test of their own.
